TI  - Implementing agentic AI in project management: an evidence-based framework and maturity model from systematic analysis
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF MANAGING PROJECTS IN BUSINESS
LA  - English
KW  - Agentic AI
KW  - Autonomous agents
