T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2026 CHI CONFERENCE ON HUMAN FACTORS IN COMPUTING SYSTEMS, CHI 2026
LA  - English
CP  - 2026 Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems-CHI
