TI  - Chat-Driven Computational (Bio)chemistry: Using LLM Agents to Accelerate Bio- and Chemoinformatics
T2  - JOURNAL OF CHEMICAL INFORMATION AND MODELING
LA  - English
KW  - MOLECULAR-DYNAMICS
