TI  - SafeCodeRL: Security-Constrained Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning for Trustworthy LLM-Generated IoT/CPS Software
T2  - SENSORS
LA  - English
KW  - large language models
KW  - secure code generation
KW  - IoT security
