TI  - Autonomous GIS: the next-generation AI-powered GIS
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF DIGITAL EARTH
LA  - English
KW  - Spatial analysis
KW  - autonomous agent
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - large language models
